# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Ancient Magic — Front and Back Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Ancient Magic (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits (p. 2), Further Reading (p. 143) and Contributors (p. 144)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits, the book’s bibliography (Further Reading, a box on p. 143) and the contributors’ biographies,
> verbatim. The front cover (p. 1) prints no text within the page; the printed Contents (pp. 3–4) is a finding
> aid for the book’s own pages and is not converted — every unit it lists is converted in its chapter. The PDF
> has no back cover.

---

